# ───────── Large local data — NEVER commit (41 GB QLever index) ─────────
yago/
*.zip

# DBpedia: the 4 GB of downloaded parts and the index built from them. The small
# files that let anyone rebuild it — Qleverfile, download.sh, rdf-input.urls and
# DATASET.md — are deliberately NOT ignored.
qlever-workspace/dbpedia/rdf-input/
qlever-workspace/dbpedia/dbpedia.*
qlever-workspace/dbpedia/*.log

